Value Filldown LOCAL_PORT (\S+)
Value Required CHASSIS_ID (\S+)
Value PORT_ID (\S+)
Value PORT_DESC (.*?)
Value SYSTEM_NAME (.*?)
Value SYSTEM_DESC (.*?)
Value MGMT_ADDRESS ([\d.]+)

Start
  ^Port\s+:\s+${LOCAL_PORT}\s*$$ -> Clear
  ^Neighbor System-Name\s+:\s*${SYSTEM_NAME}\s*$$
  ^Neighbor System-Description\s+:\s*${SYSTEM_DESC}\s*$$
  ^Neighbor Chassis-ID\s+:\s*${CHASSIS_ID}\s*$$
  ^Neighbor Management-Address\s+:\s*${MGMT_ADDRESS}
  ^Neighbor Port-ID\s+:\s*${PORT_ID}\s*$$
  ^Neighbor Port-Desc\s+:\s*${PORT_DESC}\s*$$
  ^TTL\s+: -> Record
